is titles, and tick formatting"],[1466,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[569,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1407,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[571,"**DOM Output:**"],[1329,"**End**"],[240,"**errorMessage**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[516,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[587,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[575,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[560,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[508,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1104,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[563,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1425,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1437,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1327,"**Home**"],[804,"**Home** / **End**: jump to `minValue` or `maxValue` when those props are set"],[1440,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1429,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1605,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1596,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[538,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[578,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1408,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[239,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[238,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1432,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[1100,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1261,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[654,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1346,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1465,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[574,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1427,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[591,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1431,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1264,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[585,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[903,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[506,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[803,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[572,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[589,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[582,"**Provide fallback content