ries with grouped bars"],[1101,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[652,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1325,"**Space / Enter**"],[952,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[245,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[700,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1076,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[567,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[577,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1441,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1430,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[517,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[561,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1321,"**Tab**"],[244,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[949,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1074,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[905,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1317,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1316,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1445,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1434,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[576,"**Trade-offs:**"],[518,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[703,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1607,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[511,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop