563,"\\`tooltipValueFormatter\\` shapes only the tooltip values, so you can show full currency or units there while the axis stays compact."],[1551,"\\`xBaseline\\` and \\`yBaseline\\` control the main axis lines themselves. Dropping them gives a lighter, more editorial chart."],[1419,"\\`xDomain\\` and \\`yDomain\\` pin down exactly which categories and value range to draw. Here category \\`F\\` has no data and still gets an empty slot, and the Y range stays \\`\\[0, 40]\\` even though the largest bar is 30 - handy when several charts need to share a scale."],[1556,"\\`xDomain\\` and \\`yDomain\\` pin the visible range. Use them to keep a fixed scale, or to keep several charts comparable."],[1547,"\\`xGridlines\\` and \\`yGridlines\\` add faint lines across the plot so it is easier to read a value back off an axis."],[1549,"\\`xLabels\\` and \\`yLabels\\` toggle the tick labels on each axis. Turn them off for sparklines or when the surrounding UI already names the values."],[1557,"\\`xNice\\` and \\`yNice\\` round the domain out to friendlier numbers (e.g. 0.2 to 1.0), so ticks land on values people expect."],[1560,"\\`xPaddingOuter\\` and \\`yPaddingOuter\\` add breathing room at the ends of a band or point scale so the first and last values are not pinned to the edges."],[1420,"\\`xTickFormat\\` and \\`yTickFormat\\` shape the axis labels - abbreviated dates on one axis, thousands separators on the other. The functions receive the raw accessor value, so they also cover currency, units, or percentages."],[1553,"\\`xTickFormat\\` and \\`yTickFormat\\` shape the axis labels - dates, currency, units, percentages - and the tooltip follows the same formatting."],[1550,"\\`xTickMarks\\` and \\`yTickMarks\\` draw the short lines at each tick value, which helps tie a label to its exact position on the axis."],[1548,"\\`xTitle\\` and \\`yTitle\\` label what each axis actually measures, e.g. \"Month\" and \"Temperature (°F)\"."],[1558,"\\`xZero\\` and \\`yZero\\` stretch the domain to include zero. Worth doing when the absolute size of the values matters, not just their movement."],[1166,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1163,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1172,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1173,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1161,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1167,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1170,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1164,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1176,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[436,"`[data-disabled]`"],[440,"`[data-focused]`"],[438,"`[data-invalid]`"],[176,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[312,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives. Locale comes from a host `<I18nProvider>`. This version has no typed/segmented entry - selection is via the calendar."],[1650,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1652,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1646,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1648,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1653,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1649,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1647,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1651,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1603,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[463,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[955,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1079,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[287,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[247,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[956,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1080,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[249,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[958,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1333,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1081,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[366,"`aria-label=\"Close\"` on the built-in close button"],[286,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[859,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[248,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[957,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[284,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[857,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[856,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value"],[283,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[858,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[285,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1595,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[175,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[891,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[541,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[544,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[540,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[542,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[543,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[545,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1154,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[307,"`DatePicker` (single